                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "talking to other students about their displays."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 22,
                "textHtml": "In last year's exhibition, both students were impressed by",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "a set of metal sculptures."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "a series of wooden models."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "a collection of textile designs."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 23,
                "textHtml": "What has Max decided to call his display?",
                "options": [
